      <div class="k"><span class="ico"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#c4b3ff" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round"><path d="M12 3v12m0 0l-4-4m4 4l4-4M4 19h16"/></svg></span>Queue Position</div>
