        <label class="switch"><input type="checkbox" id="logWrap" checked /> Wrap lines</label>
        <div style="flex:1"></div>
        <button class="btn sm" id="btnCopyLogs"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><rect x="9" y="9" width="11" height="11" rx="2"/><path d="M5 15V5a2 2 0 012-2h10"/></svg>Copy</button>
        <button class="btn sm" id="btnClearLogs"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"><path d="M4 7h16M9 7V5h6v2M6 7l1 13h10l1-13"/></svg>Clear</button>
        <button class="btn sm" id="btnLogsRefresh"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"><path d="M21 12a9 9 0 11-3-6.7M21 4v5h-5"/></svg>Refresh Logs</button>
      </div>
      <div class="term" id="term"><div class="t-dim">Loading logs…</div></div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="foot">
    Engine endpoints: <code>/api/status</code> · <code>/api/jobs</code> · <code>/api/scan</code> · <code>/api/pause</code> · <code>/api/resume</code> · <code>/api/retry/:id</code> · <code>/api/queue/purge</code> · <code>/api/failed</code> · <code>/api/history</code> · <code>/api/logs</code>
    <br/>Served by <code>bun run batch_playlist_downloader.ts</code> — UI auto-detects the backend and falls back to demo data.
  </div>
</div>

<!-- ============ ADD MODAL ============ -->
<div class="overlay" id="ovAdd">
  <div class="modal">
    <header>
      <div class="logo" style="width:34px;height:34px;border-radius:9px">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" style="width:18px;height:18px"><path d="M9 4.5l9 6-9 6v-12z" fill="#ff3b5c"/></svg>
      </div>
      <div style="flex:1">
        <h2>Add New Playlist / Channel</h2>
        <p>One URL per line — scanned with <span class="mono">yt-dlp --flat-playlist</span> and queued idempotently.</p>
      </div>
      <button class="iconbtn" data-close="ovAdd"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"><path d="M6 6l12 12M18 6L6 18"/></svg></button>
    </header>
    <div class="body">
      <div class="field">
        <label for="inUrl">URLs</label>
        <textarea id="inUrl" placeholder="https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PL…&#10;https://www.youtube.com/@channel/videos"></textarea>
